  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-900 via-indigo-900 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>❄️</span><span>2026年 冬〜年末年始旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      冬の味覚解禁（カニ・ふぐ・寒ブリ）や雪見露天・年末年始の宿泊枠は例年10月中旬〜11月上旬で満室が急増します。空室状況はお早めに確認を。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    ✨ 津和野・益田おすすめ宿10選の空室・伊勢海老料理＆宿泊プランをチェック →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026年最新】津和野・益田おすすめ宿10選！山陰の小京都・殿町通り＆益田温泉</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">錦鯉が優雅に泳ぐ白壁の掘割厳選宿。朱色の鳥居が山を染める厳選宿。文豪・森鴎外の生家。日本海の荒波が打ち寄せる厳選宿、そして益田の次世代クラフト温泉ホテル厳選宿。</p>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">島根西部エリア（津和野・益田）の立地を整理し、<strong>「クラフトマンシップデザインホテル・小京都の老舗宿・日本海波打ち際露天」で絶対に失敗しない厳選10選</strong>の魅力と見どころを紹介します。！</p>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🗺️ 津和野・益田エリアの距離感マップ</h2>\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 bg-stone-900 text-amber-300 font-mono text-xs rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto shadow-inner leading-relaxed\"><pre>【JR益田駅（萩・石見空港）】（MASCOS HOTEL・荒磯温泉 荒磯館）\n      │\n      │ JR山口線特急で約30分 / 国道9号:車で約35分\n      ▼\n【津和野（殿町通り・太皷谷稲成神社・SLやまぐち号終点）】（若さぎの宿・若槻 津和野）\n      │\n      └── (JR山口線で約1時間 / 国道9号:車約1時間) ──▶ 【山口県 湯田温泉・新山口駅】</pre></div>\n<li class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 ml-4 list-disc my-1\"><strong>萩・石見空港 ⇔ 益田駅</strong>: 連絡バスで約15分</li>\n<li class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 ml-4 list-disc my-1\"><strong>新山口駅 ⇔ 津和野駅</strong>: JR特急厳選宿で約1時間</li>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 津和野・益田：失敗しないおすすめ厳選10選</h2>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">1. ＭＡＳＣＯＳ ＨＯＴＥＬ（益田市・JR益田駅徒歩5分）</h3>\n          </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/172875/172875.jpg\" alt=\"ＭＡＳＣＯＳ　ＨＯＴＥＬ 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.52</span>\n        </div>\n      \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜クラフトマンシップが息づく！地下天然温泉付きの次世代デザインホテル〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">一人旅、カップル、デザイン建築好き、ワーケーション。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 厳選宿</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「洗練されたモダンデザインと極上の天然温泉サウナを味わうなら迷わずここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F172875%2F172875.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】ＭＡＳＣＯＳ　ＨＯＴＥＬ の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">2. 若さぎの宿（津和野町・津和野駅徒歩5分）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.73</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/53775/53775.jpg\" alt=\"若さぎの宿 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜創業以来のおもてなし！地元の山菜と津和野名物料理を味わう純和風宿〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">小京都散策、歴史好き、ご夫婦、一人旅。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 厳選宿</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「津和野の風情ある町並みと心温まる郷土の味を満喫するならここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F53775%2F53775.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n            ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】若さぎの宿 の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">3. 荒磯温泉 荒磯館（益田市・日本海沿い）</h3>\n          </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/12640/12640.jpg\" alt=\"荒磯温泉　荒磯館 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.62</span>\n        </div>\n      \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜日本海の波しぶき！全室オーシャンビュー＆海に突き出た絶景露天風呂〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">海絶景好き、魚好き、ご夫婦、記念日。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emer